{"ID":"20240504170641-2k2ur0h","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170641-2k2ur0h","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170641-2k2ur0h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170641-9zt5xz4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611163944-x2b1clk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2072,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611164414-cd8tjfd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:15,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:15\u0026#125;","title":"189水萍（浮萍）","type":"doc","updated":"20240820111305"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240625111226-2xrsoa7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625111226-2xrsoa7","updated":"20240625111228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240625111226-9ri1z1z.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240625111724-ycf498t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625111724-ycf498t","updated":"20240820111010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 545px;","style":"width: 535px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"浮萍 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/浮萍 1-20240820111008-9n99get.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 535px;\" parent-style=\"width: 545px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820111049-12wclrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820111049-12wclrd","updated":"20240820111224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"浮萍 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/浮萍 2-20240820111049-5px83j3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 586px;","style":"width: 576px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"浮萍 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/浮萍 3-20240820111122-ctyix18.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 576px;\" parent-style=\"width: 586px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625111300-u1iphfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625111300-u1iphfp","updated":"20240820111226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 566px;","style":"width: 556px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"浮萍3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/浮萍3-20240625111508-n8akoy5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 556px;\" parent-style=\"width: 566px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 636px;","style":"width: 626px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"浮萍"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/浮萍-20240820110925-kkvsspy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 626px;\" parent-style=\"width: 636px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625111952-iezf4f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625111952-iezf4f7","updated":"20240820111305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"浮萍2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/浮萍2-20240625112017-zs9cwh1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 842px;","style":"width: 832px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"浮萍 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/浮萍 4-20240820111305-u3e8s5z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 832px;\" parent-style=\"width: 842px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611163941-eye4ml0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163941-eye4ml0"}},{"ID":"20240611164105-p7ts783","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164105-p7ts783","updated":"20240611164115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164105-nw0zjhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164105-nw0zjhc","updated":"20240611164105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164105-o2tgpts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164105-o2tgpts","updated":"20240611164105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主暴热身痒（艺文类聚初学记痒，此是），下水气胜酒，长须发（艺文类聚作乌发），消渴。久服轻身。一名水华（艺文类聚引云：一名水廉）。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164105-0i9f38k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164105-0i9f38k","updated":"20240611164105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：水萍一名水廉，生泽水上，叶员小，一茎，一叶，根入水，五月华白，三月采，日干。（《御览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611164105-ae93fpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164105-ae93fpy","updated":"20240611164105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一始水白，一名水苏，生雷泽，三月采，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164105-uf6f6h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164105-uf6f6h8","updated":"20240611164105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：萍，蓱也，无根，浮水而生者。萍，苹也，（上卄下宾），大萍也。《广雅》云：薸，萍也。《夏小正》云：七月湟潦生苹。《尔雅》云：萍苹。郭璞云：水中浮萍，江东谓之薸.又其大者苹。《毛诗》云：于以采苹。《传》云：苹，大萍也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164105-xwblc3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164105-xwblc3f","updated":"20240611164105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《范子计然》曰：水萍出三辅，色青者善。《《淮南子》·原道训》云：萍树根于水。高诱云：萍，大苹也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164116-6wn7b3o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164116-6wn7b3o"}},{"ID":"20240611164122-k9si46u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-k9si46u","updated":"20240611164126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-vntmvm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-vntmvm8","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」辛、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-ciasfcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-ciasfcg","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-8c90xg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-8c90xg8","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、伤寒。用紫背浮萍一钱、犀角悄半钱、钩藤钩几个，共研为末。每服半钱，蜜水调下，以出汗为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-4y716rf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-4y716rf","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、消渴。喝水甚多，用浮萍捣汁服。又方：用干浮萍、栝楼根，等分为末，加入乳汁和成丸子，如梧子大，每空心服二十丸。痛三年者，服药数日可愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-wp1eafo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-wp1eafo","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、水肿，小便不利，用浮萍晒干，研为末。每服一匙，开水送下。一天服二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-zwqm6v2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-zwqm6v2","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、吐血。用紫背浮萍（炽）半两、黄芪（炙）二钱半，共研为末。每服一钱，姜蜜水调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-217j2fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-217j2fn","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、中小毒病（手足指冷至膝肘）。用浮萍晒干，研为末，每服一匙，水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-qanae7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-qanae7b","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、脱肛。用紫背浮萍为末，干敷患处。此方名“水圣散”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-2kc5kb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-2kc5kb0","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、风热隐疹。用浮萍（蒸过，焙干）、牛蒡子（酒煮，晒干，炒）各一两，共研为末。每服一至二钱，薄荷送下。一天服二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-bjjnzh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-bjjnzh2","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、风热丹毒。用浮萍捣汁涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-cfqc495","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-cfqc495","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、汗斑癜风。夏季收紫背浮萍晒干，每了四两煎水洗浴，并以萍直接搽抹。水中加汉防己二钱亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-sp10w3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-sp10w3k","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、大风疠疾。春末采浮萍草，淘三、五次，窨三、五日，焙为末。避日光收存。每服三钱，饭前服，温酒送下。忌食猪肉、消风散五两。每服五钱，水煎，频饮。同时以浮萍煎汤洗浴。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-2eisljb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-2eisljb","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、毒肿初起。用浮萍捣烂敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164122-f4tzvjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164122-f4tzvjl","updated":"20240611164122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、烧烟去蚊。夏季取浮萍阴干烧成灰，可将蚊虫熏去。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164134-7a5r64m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164134-7a5r64m"}},{"ID":"20240611164135-uzs8jrq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164135-uzs8jrq","updated":"20240611164143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164135-i0x1ao7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164135-i0x1ao7","updated":"20240611164135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、酸，寒，无毒。主暴热身痒，下水气，胜酒，长须发，止消渴，下气。以沐浴，生毛发。久服轻身。一名水花，一名水白，一名水苏。生雷泽池泽。三月采，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164135-7x5a74n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164135-7x5a74n","updated":"20240611164135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶此是水中大萍尔，非今浮萍子。《药录》云∶五月有花，白花。即非今沟渠所生者。楚王渡江所得，非斯实也。唐本注云∶水萍者，有三种，大者名苹。水中又有荇菜，亦相似，而叶圆。水上小浮萍，主火疮。今按陈藏器本草云∶水萍有三种，大者曰苹，叶圆阔寸许，叶下有一点如水沫，一名 菜。曝干。与栝蒌等分，以人乳为丸，主消渴。捣绞取汁饮，主蛇咬毒入腹，亦可敷热疮。小萍子是沟渠间者。末敷面 ，捣汁服之，主水肿，利小便。又人中毒，取萍子曝干，末，酒服方寸匕。又为膏，长发。《本经》云水萍，应是小者。臣禹锡等谨按尔雅云∶苹， 。其大者苹。注∶水中浮 ，江东谓之 ，陆机《毛诗义疏》云∶其粗大者谓之苹，小者曰 。季春始生，可糁蒸为茹，又可苦酒淹以就酒。日华子云∶治热毒风，热疾，热狂， 肿毒，汤火疮，风疹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164135-muechri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164135-muechri","updated":"20240611164135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶水萍，生雷泽地泽，今处处溪涧水中皆有之。此是水中大萍，叶圆阔寸许，叶下有菜。《尔雅》谓之苹。其大者曰苹是也。《周南诗》云∶于以采苹。陆谓之萍。季春始生，可糁蒸，以为茹。又可用苦酒淹，以按酒。三月采，曝干。苏恭云∶此有三种∶大者曰苹；中者荇菜，即下凫葵是也。小者水上浮苹，即沟渠间生者是也。大苹，今医方鲜用。浮萍，俗医用治时行热病，亦堪发汗，其有功。其方用浮萍草一两，四月十五日者，麻黄去节、根，桂心、附子炮裂去脐皮各半两，四物捣，细筛，每服二钱，以水一中盏，入生姜半分，煎至六分，不计时候，和滓热服，汗出乃瘥。又∶治恶疾遍身疮者，取水中浮萍浓煮汁，渍浴半日，多效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164135-71sncvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164135-71sncvv","updated":"20240611164135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此方甚奇古也。圣惠方∶治少年面上起细 ，挪浮萍庵之，亦可饮少许汁，良也。又方∶发背初得，毒肿 热，赤烂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164135-bn3p2id","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164135-bn3p2id","updated":"20240611164135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捣和鸡子清贴之，良。千金方∶治中水毒，手足指冷即是，或至膝肘。以浮萍日干，服方寸匕，瘥。千金翼∶治小便不利，膀胱水气流滞。以浮萍日干末，服阴干，烧烟去蚊子。又，主消渴，以浮萍汁服之。子母秘录∶热毒，浮萍捣汁敷之令遍。高供奉采萍时曰歌∶不在山，不在岸，采我之时七月半。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164135-milpwn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164135-milpwn9","updated":"20240611164135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"选甚瘫风与缓风，此小微风都不算。豆淋酒内下三丸，铁 头上也出汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164159-9fcj8fb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164159-9fcj8fb"}},{"ID":"20240611164200-nncets5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164200-nncets5","updated":"20240611164206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164200-haotuhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164200-haotuhs","updated":"20240611164200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、酸，气寒。无毒。系柳絮随风飞起，入池沼得水生成。小者藻背面俱青，大者萍面青背紫。下无根蒂，水面漂浮。入药拯 ，惟萍可用。七月半采，依法曝之。竹筛摊开，水盆架住。曝向烈日，才得燥干。（盆无水则不燥。）研末细罗。蜜丸弹大。豆淋酒化，空心顿吞。发汗骤来，驱风速退。仍治时行热病，堪浴遍身痒疮。（生采煎汤。）消水肿，利小便，去暴燥，止消渴。夏夜蚊多，烧烟可除。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164200-toiqr68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164200-toiqr68","updated":"20240611164200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（谟）按∶《普济》大风丹云∶东京开河，掘得石碑，梵书天篆，无有晓者。林灵素逐字释解，乃是治中风方。歌曰∶天生灵草无根干，不在山间不在岸。始因飞絮逐东风，泛梗青青漂水面。神仙一味去沉 ，采时须是七月半。怕甚瘫风与中风，酒下三丸都汗散。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164246-9xygsj3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164246-9xygsj3"}},{"ID":"20240611164247-a70q6c1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164247-a70q6c1","updated":"20240611164251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164247-ptyfihj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164247-ptyfihj","updated":"20240611164247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛酸，寒，无毒。主曝热身痒，下水气，胜酒，长须发，止消渴，下气。以沐浴，生毛发。久服轻身。一名水花，一名水白，一名水苏。生雷泽池泽，三月采，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164413-xazzz9p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164413-xazzz9p"}},{"ID":"20240611164414-eo1bmer","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-eo1bmer","updated":"20240611164425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-2vnzu05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-2vnzu05","updated":"20240611164414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"杨花所化生。只水中一叶，经宿即生九叶。叶下微须，即其根也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-kk8a046","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-kk8a046","updated":"20240611164414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-t18c6e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-t18c6e8","updated":"20240611164427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治暴热身痒，热毒风热热狂，肿毒。发时行热病汗，并疗风湿麻痹脚气。捣汁服，主水肿利小便，止消渴，治吐衄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-yyspxw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-yyspxw6","updated":"20240611164430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"发汗胜于麻黄。（丹溪）"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-319xm74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-319xm74","updated":"20240611164432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"专得水气之清阴，其体轻浮，其性清燥，能祛湿热之药。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-x2x4mhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-x2x4mhu","updated":"20240611164414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"杨先百木青，秉春升之敷和。萍性善生衍，秉夏出之蕃茂。但以升出为用，不以风火为气者，以基于水，遂禀水寒之化。且味专辛发，借金水之相滋，诚逐风清热，解表出汗，下水气，止消渴之良剂也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-ws78fh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-ws78fh2","updated":"20240611164434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去风丹。治瘫痪三十六种风。用紫背浮萍晒干，研细，炼蜜丸弹子大。每服一丸，豆淋酒化下，有验。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-0gw15wz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-0gw15wz","updated":"20240611164436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水气洪肿，小便不利。浮萍晒干为末，每服方寸匕，白汤下，日二服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-920vb22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-920vb22","updated":"20240611164438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鼻衄不止。浮萍末吹之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-8ztxina","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-8ztxina","updated":"20240617115511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吐血不止。紫背浮萍焙半两，黄芪炙二钱半。为末，每服一钱，姜蜜水调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-lb6wgsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-lb6wgsk","updated":"20240611164414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"消渴饮水。用干浮萍、栝蒌根等分。为末，人乳和丸梧子大。空腹服二十丸，三年者数日愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-xgu4644","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-xgu4644","updated":"20240611164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风热瘾疹。浮萍蒸过焙干，牛蒡子酒煮晒干炒，各一两。为末，每薄荷汤服一二钱，日二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-86ai7s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-86ai7s1","updated":"20240611164414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕杨花入水而化萍，禀寒水之旺气，乘风木之出机。故其生也易，而化亦繁。即其味以辛胜，固皆气化出机也，乃入口微有甘酸，入血分而涌泄。随有辛之胜者，散之润之，合于人身之阴气抑遏，阴气阻滞，阴气为阳所并者。举能大畅寒水之化，而奏效于水与汗与血焉。阴气达则阳自化，而风自息，故治风热最胜。但能达阴之出机，不能借其还阴之入机耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-cd8tjfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-cd8tjfd","updated":"20240611164446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缪氏云：表气虚而自汗者，勿用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164414-nhfe5fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164414-nhfe5fd","updated":"20240611164414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕紫背者入药良。面背皆绿者，不可用。七月采之，拣净，摊竹筛中，下置水一盆映之，晒即易干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164348-ybs78wk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164348-ybs78wk"}},{"ID":"20240611164349-xer7hvk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164349-xer7hvk","updated":"20240611164353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《本草思辨录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164349-n6yavu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164349-n6yavu6","updated":"20240611164349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍浮于水面，而味辛气寒，能发皮肤中湿热之邪汗，故本经主暴热身痒。伤寒论云∶不得小汗出，身必痒。其身痒为有风寒之邪，宜以麻桂取微汗。此则湿热不汗出而痒，故水萍主之。水萍亦汗药也，而与麻桂有霄壤之殊。丹溪谓发汗胜于麻黄，不加分别。后遂有视水萍为峻剂而不敢用者矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164349-c1zhkjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164349-c1zhkjk","updated":"20240611164349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本经以下水气，止消渴，两许水萍。盖以其状外帖水面，内含血络，水不能濡，则水气自下本经未尝言风，而后世以风药推之。要知其所治为风热之风，非风寒之风。如古今录验以水萍与牛蒡子薄荷治风热瘾疹，则药病相当矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164335-iniloqd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164335-iniloqd"}},{"ID":"20240611164336-79832ry","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164336-79832ry","updated":"20240611164341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164336-lvluey2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164336-lvluey2","updated":"20240611164336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。主暴热，得水之气，故能除热。身痒，湿热在皮肤。下水气，萍入水不濡，故能涤水。胜酒，水气盛则酒气散矣。长须发，益皮毛之血气。主消渴。得水气之助。久服轻身。亦如萍之轻也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164336-g4nsstl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164336-g4nsstl","updated":"20240611164336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍生于水中，而能出水生，且其叶入水不濡，是其性能敌水者也。故凡水湿之病，皆能治之。其根不着土，而上浮水面，故又能益皮毛之疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164325-d3ecc2s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164325-d3ecc2s"}},{"ID":"20240611164326-lpkurnd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164326-lpkurnd","updated":"20240611164330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164326-6efkkls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164326-6efkkls","updated":"20240611164326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛寒，无毒。浮水面，小而背紫者是。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164326-1ut1uns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164326-1ut1uns","updated":"20240611164326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主暴热身痒，下水气胜酒，长须发，止消渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164326-yki18c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164326-yki18c6","updated":"20240611164326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮萍发汗胜于麻黄，下水捷于通草。恶疾疠风遍身者，浓煎浴半日多效。其性轻浮，入肺经达皮肤，故能发扬邪汗。《本经》主暴热身痒者，专疏肌表风热也。下水气者，兼通阳明肉理也。胜酒者，阳明通达而能去酒毒也。长须发者，毛窍利而血脉荣也。止消渴者，经气和而津液复也。浮萍为祛风专药。去风丹，用紫背浮萍为末，蜜丸，弹子大，豆淋酒下一丸。治大风癞风，一切有余，风湿香港脚及三十六种风皆验。而元气本虚人服之，未有不转增剧者。至于表虚自汗者，尤为戈戟。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164313-jhbmkfo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164313-jhbmkfo"}},{"ID":"20240611164314-h7eiesu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164314-h7eiesu","updated":"20240611164320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164314-oi7wpq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164314-oi7wpq3","updated":"20240611164314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛酸，寒，无毒。主暴热身痒，下水气，胜酒，长须发，止消渴，下气。陈脏器云曝干与栝蒌等分，以人乳为丸，主消渴。捣绞汁饮，主蛇咬毒入腹。亦可敷热疮。小萍子∶汁主水肿，利小便。又中毒，曝干末酒服方寸匕。日华子云∶治热毒风热，疾热在胁，肿毒，汤火疮，风疹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164256-hmew6dr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164256-hmew6dr"}},{"ID":"20240611164258-junecl5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164258-junecl5","updated":"20240611164304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164258-to0vgez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164258-to0vgez","updated":"20240611164258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"专得水气之清阴，故味辛酸气寒无毒。其体清浮，其性清燥，故能散皮肤之湿热而下水胜酒。消渴发汗之需也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164258-gno32gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164258-gno32gg","updated":"20240611164258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍背面俱青而小者名藻，面青背紫而大者为萍。入药用萍，七月半采，置筛架水晒干研末，蜜丸弹大，一切摊风中风，空心酒服三丸，发汗聚来，驱风速退，仍治时行热病，堪浴遍身疮痒，消水肿，利小便，发汗力比麻黄，下水功同通草，苟非大实大热，表虚自汗者勿用。歌云∶天生灵草无根干，不在山间不在岸，始因飞絮逐东风，紫背青皮飘水面，神仙一味去沉 ，采时须在七月半，怕甚瘫风与大风，些小微风都不算，豆淋酒内服三丸，铁钋头上也出汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164235-cfuqmux","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164235-cfuqmux"}},{"ID":"20240611164237-owheoav","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164237-owheoav","updated":"20240611164241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164237-yytvg5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164237-yytvg5n","updated":"20240611164237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，寒。入手太阴经。发汗，祛风，利水。治一切风热肿毒，风湿麻痹，无名风疾，及香港脚扑伤。佐犀角、钩藤，治夹惊伤寒。佐四物、黄芩，治身体虚痒。入鲤鱼腹内麻油、酒煮，治杨梅疮初发。研烂，入冰片少许，贴眼上，治 肉攀睛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164237-34dha0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164237-34dha0y","updated":"20240611164237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫背者佳。拣净，以竹筛摊晒，候干用。取鲜者煮汁，浴遍身风疾恶疮。烧烟，辟蚊。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164237-m5w4mx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164237-m5w4mx4","updated":"20240611164237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"发汗胜于麻黄。血虚肤燥，（服之血涸则死。）气虚风痛，（服之汗出不止。）二者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164218-l5ykn2y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164218-l5ykn2y"}},{"ID":"20240611164220-582yu5q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164220-582yu5q","updated":"20240611164227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164220-0ochgri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164220-0ochgri","updated":"20240611164223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"水萍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生雷泽池泽，今处处溪涧水中皆有之。此是水中大萍，叶圆，阔寸许，叶下有一点如水沫，一名 菜，《尔雅》谓之 。其大者曰苹是也。周南诗云∶于以采苹。陆机云∶水中浮萍粗大者，谓之苹。季春始生，可糁蒸，以为茹。又可用苦酒淹，以按酒，三月采，曝干。苏恭云∶此有三种∶大者曰苹；中者荇菜，即下凫葵是也；小者水上浮萍，即沟渠间生者是也。大苹，今医方鲜用。浮萍，俗医用治时行热病，亦堪发汗，甚有功。其方用浮萍草一两，四月十五日者，麻黄去节根，桂心，附子炮裂去脐皮，各半两，四物捣细，筛，每服二钱，以水一中盏，入生姜半分，煎至六分，不计时候，和滓热服，汗出乃瘥。又治恶疾遍身疮者，取水中浮萍浓煮汁，渍浴半日，多效，此方甚奇古也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164147-cl2x2vc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611164147-cl2x2vc"}},{"ID":"20240611164148-zaz9fo8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164148-zaz9fo8","updated":"20240611164153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164148-7cdqhxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164148-7cdqhxf","updated":"20240611164148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、酸，寒，无毒。主暴热身痒，下水气，胜酒，长须发，止消渴，下气。以沐浴，生毛发。久服轻身。一名水花，一名水白，一名水苏。生雷泽池泽。三月采，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164148-k4qhzat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164148-k4qhzat","updated":"20240611164148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此是水中大萍尔，非今浮萍子。《药录》云∶五月有花，白色，即非今沟渠所生者。楚王渡江所得，非斯实也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164148-3puidyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164148-3puidyo","updated":"20240611164148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕水萍者，有三种∶大者名萍，中者曰荇，小者即水上浮萍叶圆。水上小浮萍，主火疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163941-drvyx7y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163941-drvyx7y"}},{"ID":"20240611164056-07n3xba","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164056-07n3xba","updated":"20240611164100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164056-prmvfxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164056-prmvfxu","updated":"20240611164056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛、寒。主暴热，（得水之气，故能除热）。身痒，（湿热在皮肤）。下水气（萍入水不濡，故能涤水）。胜酒，（水气胜则酒气散矣）。长须发，（益皮毛之血气）。主消渴。（得水气之助）。久服轻身。（亦如萍之轻也）徐灵胎曰∶水萍生于水中，而能出水上，且其叶入水不濡，是其性能敌水者也。故凡水湿之病皆能治之。其根不着土而上浮水面，故又能主皮毛之疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163941-nsutcyg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163941-nsutcyg"}},{"ID":"20240611164041-gx9narh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611164041-gx9narh","updated":"20240611164046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水萍《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611164041-e1bmpus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164041-e1bmpus","updated":"20240611164041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛寒，无毒。主治暴热身痒，下水气，胜酒，长须发，止消渴。久服轻身。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164041-xny5e41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164041-xny5e41","updated":"20240611164041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（水萍处处池泽止水中皆有。季春始生，而盛于夏。一叶过宿即生数叶，叶下有微须，即其根也。叶小而圆，面青背紫，其紫赤若血者，谓之紫背浮萍，入药为良。七月收采，置竹筛内，下以盆水映之晒日中，方易干也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611164041-8tppj3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164041-8tppj3g","updated":"20240611164041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳之气，根于水中，而外浮于肤表。萍生水中，浮于水面，盖禀太阳之气化。其背紫赤，皆连于水，乃太阳之气，根于水中也。盛于暑夏，乃太阳之气，开浮而主夏也。气味辛寒者，辛属干金，太阳如天而合干。寒本太阳，太阳标阳而本寒也。主治暴热身痒者，风热之邪，暴客皮肤，一身苦痒。水萍禀寒水之气，外行肤表，故暴热身痒可治也。下水气者，太阳之气外达皮毛，则膀胱之水气自下也。胜酒者，酒性辛温而剽悍，先行皮肤。水萍辛寒而解热，亦先行皮肤，故能胜酒。长须发者，太阳为诸阳主气，而熏肤泽毛，须发长也。得寒水之精气，故止消渴。久服则阴精盛而阳气充，故轻身。"}]},{"ID":"20240611164041-vsaaa72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611164041-vsaaa72","updated":"20240611164041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳之气出于水中，上与君火相合而主日。水萍下为水映，上为日晒方干，乃太阳之气，上下相通，此物理自然之妙用也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163941-wn4sqrs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163941-wn4sqrs"}},{"ID":"20240611163942-sh84nyx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-sh84nyx","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：浮萍"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-71je8oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-71je8oz","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-n8cmzod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-n8cmzod","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fú Pínɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-1eaigib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-1eaigib","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-5rdjzi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-5rdjzi0","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 水萍、水萍草、浮萍草"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-jitnulr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-jitnulr","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-3e25qau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-3e25qau","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" HERBA SPIRODELAE"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-t8cv745","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-t8cv745","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-qkhlue8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-qkhlue8","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为浮萍科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"紫萍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Spirodela polyrrhiza （L.） Schleid. 的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。6～9月采收，洗净，除去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-fg0g7fu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-fg0g7fu","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-n8lp71z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-n8lp71z","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为扁平叶状体，呈卵形或卵圆形，长径2～5mm。上表面淡绿色至灰绿色，偏侧有1小凹陷，边缘整齐或微卷曲。下表面紫绿色至紫棕色，着生数条须根。体轻，手捻易碎。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-m4j8sqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-m4j8sqe","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-s0v945h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-s0v945h","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防潮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-9orv6cd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-9orv6cd","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ju42jw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ju42jw2","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肺经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-m490162","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-m490162","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-nr0zf6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-nr0zf6c","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-upndsf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-upndsf1","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-0yjnjei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-0yjnjei","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 宣散风热，透疹，利尿。用于麻疹不透，风疹瘙痒，水肿尿少。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-xoth6u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-xoth6u0","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-0yzrp12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-0yzrp12","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3～9g。外用适量，煎汤浸洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-9pv8rt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-9pv8rt3","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-8c3w3c1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-8c3w3c1","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）用于外感风热及麻疹透发不畅等症，临床常与西河柳、牛蒡子、薄荷等配伍应用。对风热瘾疹亦可内服、外用。浮萍能泄热利水，故对于水肿而有表热者用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-pg2y24b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-pg2y24b","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-fhdfnwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-fhdfnwu","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-bemd59d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-bemd59d","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：浮萍"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-na9if6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-na9if6o","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-b6fikjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-b6fikjm","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fú Pínɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-q1ec7yq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-q1ec7yq","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-v06po6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-v06po6w","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苹（《尔雅》），水萍、水花（《本经》），浮蓱、薸（《尔雅》郭璞注），萍子草（《补缺肘后方》），水白、水苏（《别录》），小萍子（《本草拾遗》），浮萍草（《本草图经》），水藓（《品汇精要》），水帘、九子萍（《群芳谱》），田萍（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-q7pmerv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-q7pmerv","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-u5reot8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-u5reot8","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《唐本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-z2p53dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-z2p53dg","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-o3ytv7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-o3ytv7d","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为浮萍科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"紫背浮萍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"青萍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。6～9月间捞取，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-iat9j7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-iat9j7s","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ya9637s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ya9637s","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①紫背浮萍（《圣济总录》），又名：紫萍（《淮南万毕术》），紫浮萍（《世医得效方》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-hzv8emj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-hzv8emj","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生漂浮植物。叶状茎扁平，倒卵形或椭圆形，直径3～6毫米，长6～9毫米，先端圆，上面绿色，有光泽，下面紫红色，常3～4片相连，自中央下垂10馀条纤维状须根，中心有显明的维管束一条，束端有根帽。佛焰苞短小，唇形。花序由2个雄花及1个雌花组成，白色或淡绿色。花期夏季。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-dp792bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-dp792bw","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于湖沼、池塘或水田中。我国各地都有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-xixd8gl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-xixd8gl","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②青萍（《世医得效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-xdb4v8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-xdb4v8c","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与上种相似而较小，叶状茎倒卵形或矩圆形，长2～6毫米，两面均呈绿色或暗绿色。根单生下垂于水中，不具维管束，先端有钝头的根帽。花细小白色。花期4～6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-u11n05w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-u11n05w","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生长在池沼、湖泊或静水中。我国各地均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-wtpu489","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-wtpu489","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-49m97yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-49m97yg","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 紫背浮萍含醋酸钾及氯化钾及碘、溴等物质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-l16casx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-l16casx","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青萍含多量维生素B1、B2、C等水溶性维生素，木犀草素-7-β-葡萄糖甙。8-羟基木犀草素-8-β-葡萄糖甙等黄酮类及碘、溴等物质。其多糖是D-洋芫荽糖的丰富来源。尚含树脂、蜡质、甾类、叶绿素、糖、蛋白质、粘液质、鞣质等。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-6l7t6xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-6l7t6xr","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-yly8n3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-yly8n3s","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①对心血管的作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-l15n951","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-l15n951","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青萍水浸膏对奎宁引起衰竭的蛙心有强心作用，钙可增强之，大剂量使心脏停止于舒张期；并能收缩血管使血压上升。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-gm1my5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-gm1my5w","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②解热作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-87q9dne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-87q9dne","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青萍煎剂及浸剂2克/公斤，经口给予因注射伤寒混合疫苗而发热的家兔，证明有微弱的解热作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-7eo5hvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-7eo5hvh","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③其他作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-l59v7oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-l59v7oz","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青萍抗菌、抗疟实验均为阴性，在实验室及现场对库蚊幼虫及蚊蛹有杀灭作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-6bqytzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-6bqytzd","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-gbff46l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-gbff46l","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肺经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-bhdz0b8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-bhdz0b8","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"入肺经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-licz5v9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-licz5v9","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺、小肠二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-2l395jg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-2l395jg","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草求真》：\"入肝、脾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-37ylhlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-37ylhlj","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ef72ei3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ef72ei3","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-rpi3dco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-rpi3dco","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-phjyjpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-phjyjpk","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"酸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-s1cx5ds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-s1cx5ds","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《滇南本草》：\"性寒，味苦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-cc6vm2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-cc6vm2t","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《医林纂要》：\"辛，平，有咸味。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-nxsdfu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-nxsdfu5","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-54rl23u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-54rl23u","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经巯》：\"表气虚而自汗者勿用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-oaevoxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-oaevoxt","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草从新》：\"非大实大热，不可轻试。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-4prumk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-4prumk7","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《得配本草》：\"血虚肤燥，气虚风痛，二者禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-26ifuk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-26ifuk7","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-4qna8iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-4qna8iw","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 发汗，祛风，行水，清热，解毒。治时行热病，斑疹不透，风热瘾疹，皮肤瘙痒，水肿，癃闭，疮癣，丹毒，烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-tedjrah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-tedjrah","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主暴热身痒，下水气，胜酒，长须发，止消渴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-o0h68qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-o0h68qw","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"下气，以沐浴生毛发。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-3m1vdmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-3m1vdmp","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"主火疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-qa9xluv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-qa9xluv","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草拾遗》：\"末敷面酐；捣汁服之，主水肿，利小便；又人中毒，取萍子暴干末，酒服方寸匕；又为膏长发。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-opzi5qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-opzi5qz","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"治热毒风热疾，热狂，熔肿毒，汤火疮，风疹。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-hwbrwpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-hwbrwpn","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草图经》：\"治时行热病，亦堪发汗。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-244bjg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-244bjg4","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《滇南本草》：\"发汗，解毒。治疥癞，疥癣，祛皮肤瘙痒之风。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-v6l1e90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-v6l1e90","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《纲目》：\"主风湿麻痹，脚气，打扑损伤，目赤翳膜，口舌生疮，吐血，衄血，瘫风，丹毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-6rmoy5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-6rmoy5r","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《玉楸药解》：\"辛凉发表。治瘟疫斑疹，中风歪斜，瘫痪；医痈疽热肿，隐疹瘙痒，杨梅，粉刺，汗斑。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ly16f1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ly16f1j","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩《岭南采药录》：\"凡患风癍，以紫背浮萍沐浴数次；凡中水毒，手足至肘膝俱冷，用之煎水浸洗。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-gc3yosy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-gc3yosy","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾《中国药植图鉴》：\"捣汁涂敷虫咬伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-1x5p3kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-1x5p3kj","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-t7bbadj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-t7bbadj","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～2钱（鲜者0.5～1两）；捣汁或入丸、散。外用：煎水熏洗，研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-0x4h0e1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-0x4h0e1","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-aq64dvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-aq64dvt","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治时行热病，发汗：浮萍草一两，麻黄（去节、根）、桂心、附子（炮裂，去脐、皮）各半两。四物捣细筛。每服二钱，以水一中盏，入生姜半分，煎至六分，不计时候，和滓热服。（《本草图经》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-top011k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-top011k","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治皮肤风热，遍身生瘾疹：牛蒡子、浮萍等分。以薄荷汤调下二钱，日二服。（《养生必用方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ahtutcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ahtutcw","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治身上虚痒：浮萍末一钱，黄芩一钱。同四物汤煎汤调下。（《丹溪纂要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-qc1wnqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-qc1wnqo","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治热渴不止，心神烦躁：水中萍，洗，曝干为末，以牛乳汁和丸，如梧桐子大。每服不计时候，以粥饮下三十丸。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-69ld14k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-69ld14k","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治消渴：干浮萍、栝蒌根等分。上二味为末，以人乳汁和丸如梧子。空腹饮服二十丸，日三。（《千金方》浮萍丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-61kd115","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-61kd115","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治热毒：浮萍捣汁，敷之令遍。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-hinznof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-hinznof","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治大风疠疾：㈠浮萍草，三月采，淘三、五次，窨三、五日，焙为末，不得见日。每服三钱，食前温酒下。㈡七月取紫背浮萍，日干为末，半升，入好消风散五两。每服五钱，水煎频饮；仍以煎汤洗浴之。（《十便良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-4xe9bw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-4xe9bw3","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治痈：紫萍适量，打汁，红茴香（山木蟹）根皮打粉，一食匙。上药调匀外敷，中薄外厚，中间留孔。（《单方验方调查资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-n0xmbvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-n0xmbvu","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治小便不通，利膀胱胀，水气流肿：水上浮萍，暴干，末，服方寸匕，日三服，（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-k0lnvw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-k0lnvw9","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治急性肾炎：浮萍草二两，黑豆一两。水煎服。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-vberyks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-vberyks","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治疮疹入眼，痛楚不忍，恐伤其目：浮萍草，阴干为末，每服一、二钱，用羊子肝半斤，入盆子内，以竹杖子刺碎烂。投水半合，绞取肝汁，食后调药服之。（《小儿卫生总微论方》浮萍散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ddtgpvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ddtgpvo","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治汗斑癜风：紫背浮萍，晒干。每以四两煎水浴，并以萍擦之。或入汉防己二钱亦可。（《袖珍方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-k6hk0fr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-k6hk0fr","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治粉滓面酐：沟渠小萍，为末，日敷之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-bji5grq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-bji5grq","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁解蛇咬毒入腹：浮萍草捣绞汁饮之。（《品汇精要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-52lofbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-52lofbi","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治鼻衄不止：干浮萍草末，吹入鼻中。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ikwbi4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ikwbi4y","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治胬肉攀睛：青萍少许，研烂，入片脑少许，贴眼上。（《世医得效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ew2v4nb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ew2v4nb","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-t1m9cd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-t1m9cd7","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草衍义补遗》：\"水萍，发汗尤甚麻黄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-adjeqse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-adjeqse","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"浮萍，其性轻浮，入肺经，达皮肤，所以能发扬邪汗也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-x6hfom0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-x6hfom0","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"水萍，其体轻浮，其性清燥，能祛湿热之药也。热气郁于皮肤则作痒，味辛而气清寒；故能散皮肤之湿热也。寒能除热，燥能除湿，故下水气。酒性湿热，而萍之质不沈于水，其气味辛寒，轻清而散，故能胜酒。血热则须发焦枯而易堕，凉血则营气清而须发自长矣。《别录》主消渴者，以湿热之邪去，则津液自生，而渴自止也。其曰下气，以沐浴生毛发者，亦以寒能除热，凉血之验也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-4vihuhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-4vihuhr","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④张寿颐：\"浮萍，轻浮最甚，故上宣肺气，外达皮毛，发汗泄热，下通水道，《本经》、《别录》、大明诸家主治，无不在此范围之内。然不仅专入气分，而兼清血热，故《圣济》以治吐血不止，《圣惠方》又治鼻衄，濒湖以治目赤、口疮，既善清火，而又导热下行，其效良捷。近人止以为发汗之药，而不知清热正其专长，殊觉未尽其用。且其质最轻，气味皆薄虽曰发汗，性非温热，必无过汗之虑。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-uzj76hp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-uzj76hp","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-y9azurc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-y9azurc","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-bz8ji81","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-bz8ji81","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：浮萍"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-oykufpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-oykufpk","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ivsajpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ivsajpx","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fú Pínɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-9ffp15y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-9ffp15y","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-x8bekib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-x8bekib","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 水萍、水花、浮萍、藻、萍子草、小萍子、浮萍草、水藓、水帘、九子萍、田萍"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-zf1smz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-zf1smz3","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-sucl684","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-sucl684","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Common Ducksmeat Herb"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-9067zio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-9067zio","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-idpoyx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-idpoyx0","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《唐本草》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-gevrrqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-gevrrqs","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《唐本草》：水萍者，有三种： 大者名苹；水中又有蒋菜，亦相似而叶圆；水上小浮萍主火疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-qajdu7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-qajdu7i","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草拾遗》：小萍子是沟渠间者。《神农本草经》云水萍，应是小者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-yug3iiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-yug3iiw","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：《本草》所用水萍，乃小浮萍，非大苹也，陶苏俱以大苹注之误矣。萍之与苹，音虽相近，字却不同，形亦沮别。浮萍处处池泽止水中甚多，季春始生。一叶经宿，即生数叶，叶下有微须，即其根也。一种背面皆"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-conv9s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-conv9s9","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-z10oiab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-z10oiab","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为浮萍科植物紫萍或浮萍的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-pilvwrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-pilvwrt","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Spirodela polyrrhiza (L.)Schleid.[Lemna polyrrhiza L.]2.Lemna minor L."}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-4x5fkn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-4x5fkn2","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：6-9月采收。捞出后去杂质，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-upg2c0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-upg2c0a","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-t0ixz89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-t0ixz89","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生长于他沼、水田、湖湾或静水中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-cvx73wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-cvx73wc","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生长于池沼、水田、湖泊或静水中常于紫萍混生。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ns9yqec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ns9yqec","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.广布于我国南北各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-9tjkdrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-9tjkdrn","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于全国南北各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-8c5b3ld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-8c5b3ld","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-owtbarf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-owtbarf","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.紫萍，多年生细小草本，漂浮水面。根5-11条束生，细年，纤维状，长3-5cm。在根的着生处一侧产生新芽，新芽与母体分离之前由一细弱的柄相连结。叶状体扁平，单生或2-5簇生，阔倒卵形，长4-10mm，宽4-6mm，先端钝圆，上面稍向内凹，深绿色，下面呈紫色，有不明显的掌状脉5-11条。花序生于叶状体边缘的缺刻内；花草性，雌雄同林；佛焰苞袋状，短小，2唇形，内有2雄花和1雌花，无花被；雄花有雄蕊2，花药2室，花丝纤细；雌花有雌蕊1，子房无柄，1室，具直立胚珠2，花柱短，柱头扁平或环状。果实圆形，边缘有翅。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-kypobqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-kypobqj","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花期 4-6月，果期5-7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-00aahn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-00aahn1","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.浮萍，浮水小草本。根1条，长3-4cm，纤细，根鞘无翅，根冠钝圆或截切状。叶状体对称，倒卵形、椭圆形或近圆形，长1.5-6mm，宽2-3mm，上面平滑，绿色，不透明，下面浅黄色或为紫色，全线，具不明显的3脉纹。叶状体背面一侧具囊，新叶状体于囊内形成浮出，以极短的细柄与母体相连，随后脱落。花单性，雌雄同株，生于叶状体边缘开裂处；佛焰苞翼状，内有雌花1，雄花2；雄花花药2室，花丝纤细；雌花具1雌蕊，子房巨室，具弯生胚珠1枚。果实近陀螺状，无翅。种子1颗，具凸起的胚乳和不规则的凸脉12-15条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-h2lljs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-h2lljs0","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-8vqewpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-8vqewpk","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性，喜温气候和潮湿环境，忌亚寒。宜先水田、池沼、湖泊栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-is69o6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-is69o6g","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术，用种子繁殖和分株繁殖法。种子繁殖：采收成熟种子，随采随播将种子用黄泥包成小团，每团包2-3颗种子，丢进栽培的水面里。分株繁殖：春、夏季，捞取部分母株，分散丢进栽培的水面里。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-w0hg8lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-w0hg8lk","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理，经常清除水面杂草，保持栽培水面静止；注意灌水，防止干旱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ibm1jp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ibm1jp3","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-21o1k9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-21o1k9m","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，叶状体呈卵形、卵圆形或卵状椭圆形，直径3-6mm。单个散生或2-5片集生，上表面淡绿至灰绿色，下表面此绿至紫棕色，边缘整齐或微卷，上表面两侧有一小凹陷，下表面该处生有数条须根。质轻，易碎。气微，味淡。以色绿、背紫者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-xw3cqgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-xw3cqgu","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别，叶状体表面观：上表皮细胞垂周壁波状弯曲，气孔不定式：下表皮细胞垂周壁近平直，无气孔。上表皮内侧的薄壁细胞类椭圆形至类圆形，有胞间隙，有的含草酸钙簇晶，直径13-20um；有的--含针晶，针晶长17-30m，细胞较大。下表皮内侧为通气组织，由薄壁细胞组成，细胞民间隙较大。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-digatkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-digatkt","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-955zwjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-955zwjo","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 紫萍全草含荭草素(orientin)，木犀草素-7-单糖甙(luteolin-7-monoglycoside)，牡荆素(vitexin)，芹菜素-7-单糖甙(malonylcyanidin-3-monoglucoside)，β-胡萝卜素(β-carotene)，叶黄素(luteine)，环氧叶黄素(epoxyluteine)，薹黄质(violaxanthin)及新黄质(neoxanthin)。还含脂类8%及蛋白质24.4%，脂类所含脂肪酸主要为亚麻酸(linolenic acid)，棕榈酸(palmitic acid)及亚油酸(linoleic acid)，蛋白质中亮氨酸(leucine)，天冬氨酸(aspartic acid)，谷氨酸(glutamic acid)含量占9.05%-9.79%，必需氨基酸指数(essential amino acid index)为52.2-52.7。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-fyeah92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-fyeah92","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮萍全草含反式-1，3-植二烯(trans-1,3-phytadiene)，十氢番茄红素(lycopersene)，谷甾醇(sitosterol)，植醇(phytol)，4( R)-4-羟基异植醇[4?-4-hydroxyisophytol]，(10R)-羟基-7Z，11E，13Z-十六碳三烯酸[(10R)-hydroxyhexadeca-7Z,10Z,13Z-trienoic acid]，11Z-十六碳烯酸(11Z-hexadecenoic acid)及7Z，10Z，13Z-十六碳三烯酸(7Z,10Z,13Z-hexadecatrienoic acid)。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-hvoh2yo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-hvoh2yo","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-61ujap2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-61ujap2","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.利尿作用：利尿成分为醋酸钾及氯化钾。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ozfgtbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ozfgtbn","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对心血管的作用：浮萍水浸膏对奎宁引起衰竭的蛙心有强心作用，钙可增强之，大剂量使心脏停止于舒张期；并能收缩血管使血压上升。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-mkxb3bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-mkxb3bh","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.解热作用：浮萍煎剂及浸剂2g/kg，经口服给予因注射伤寒混合疫苗而发热的家兔，证明有微弱的解热作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-psd8s5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-psd8s5w","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.其它作用：浮萍抗菌、抗疟实验均为阴性。在实验室及现场对库蚊幼虫及蚊蛹有杀灭作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-d73wtk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-d73wtk8","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-r0i59np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-r0i59np","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别取本品粗粉5g，加乙醇90ml，充分搅拌后，放置一夜，滤过，滤液于水浴蒸干，残渣加水3ml溶解，滤过。取滤液0.5ml，加浓盐酸及镁粉少量，小火加热至沸，溶液显橙色。（检查黄酮类）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-r3a9joh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-r3a9joh","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-9a4m3vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-9a4m3vz","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺；膀胱经"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-xinshae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-xinshae","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-pm5u6m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-pm5u6m5","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味辛；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-d20uztk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-d20uztk","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-0e2zvqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-0e2zvqd","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 表虚自汗者禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-p0v14l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-p0v14l9","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经疏》：表气虚而自汗看匆用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-4ay1hqm","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-4ay1hqm","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611163942-c6hdb0o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-c6hdb0o","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611163942-13djpc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-13djpc3","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草从新》：非大实大热，不可轻试。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-ym55ogf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-ym55ogf","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611163942-kklrb2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-kklrb2l","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《得配本草》：血虚肤燥，气虚风痛，二者禁用。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-7331d6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-7331d6b","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-46cfi68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-46cfi68","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 发汗解表；透疹止痒；利水消肿；清热解毒。主风热表证；麻疹不透；隐疹瘙痒；水肿；癃闭；疮癣；丹毒；烫伤"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-umhv9a4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-umhv9a4","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-bn3xp84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-bn3xp84","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-9g，鲜品15-30g；或捣汁饮；或入丸、散。外用：适量，煎水熏洗；研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-42rkt9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-42rkt9m","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-nni6tsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-nni6tsa","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治时行热病，发汗： 浮萍草一两，麻黄(去节、报)、桂心、附子(炮裂，去脐、皮)各半两。 四物捣细筛。每服二钱，以水一中盏，人生姜半分，煎至六分，不计时候，和滓热服。 (《本草图经》)②治皮肤风热，遍身生瘾疹： 牛蒡子、浮萍等分。以薄荷汤调下二钱，日二服。(《养生必用方》)③治身上虚痒： 浮萍末一钱，黄苹一钱。 同四物汤煎汤调下。 (《丹溪纂要》)④治热渴不止中乙神烦躁： 水中萍，洗，曝干为末，以中乳汁和丸，如梧桐子大。每服不计时候， 以粥快下三十九。(《圣惠方》)⑤治消渴： 干浮萍、括萎根等分。 上二味为末，以人乳汁和丸如梧干。空腹饮服二十丸，日三。(《千金方》·浮萍丸)⑥治热毒： 浮萍捣汁，敷之令遍。(《子母秘录》)⑦治大风病痰： 一、浮萍草，三月采，淘三、五次，窖三、五日，焙为末，不得见口。每服三钱，食前温酒下。二、七月取紫背浮萍，日干为末，半升，入好消风散五两。每服五钱，水煎频钦；仍以煎汤洗浴之。(《十便良方》)⑧治痈： 紫萍适量，打汁，红菌香(山木蟹)根皮打粉，一食匙。上药调匀外敷，中薄外厚，中间留孔。 (《单方验方调查资料选编》)⑨治小便不通，利膀肮胀，水气流肿： 水上浮萍，暴干，末，服方寸巳，日三服。 (《干金方》)⑩治急性肾炎： 浮萍草二两，黑豆一两。水煎服。(内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》)11.治疮疹入眼，痛楚不忍，恐伤其目： 浮萍草，阴干为末，每服一、二钱，用羊子肝半斤，入盆子内，以竹杖子刺碎烂。投水半合， 绞取肝汁，食后调药服之。(《小儿卫生总微论方》浮萍散)12.治汗斑痈风： 紫背浮萍，晒干。每以四两煎水浴，并以萍擦之。或人汉防己二钱亦可。(《袖珍方》)13.治粉滓面黔： 沟渠小萍，为末，曰数之。 (《圣惠方》)14.解蛇咳毒入腹： 浮萍草捣绞汁饮之。 (《品汇精要》)15.治鼻舰不止： 干浮萍草末，吹入鼻中。(《圣惠方》)16.治胬肉攀睛： 青萍少许，研烂，入片脑少许，贴眼上。(《世医得效方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-gnda86h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-gnda86h","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-0q4r3yq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-0q4r3yq","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草衍义补遗》：水萍，发汗尤甚。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-hgka8t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-hgka8t0","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：浮萍，其性轻浮，入肺经，达皮肤，所以能发扬邪汗也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-krnmjbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-krnmjbd","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草经疏》：水萍，其体轻浮，其性清燥，能祛湿热之药也。热气郁于皮肤则作痒，味辛而气清寒，故能散皮肤之湿热也。寒能除热，燥能除湿，故下水气。酒性湿热，而萍之质不沈于水，其气味辛寒，轻清而散，故能胜酒。血热则须发焦枯而易堕，凉血则营气情而须发自长矣。《别录》主消渴者，以湿热之邪去，则津液自生，而渴自止也。其曰下气，以休浴生毛发者，亦以寒能除热，凉血之验也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-2gq70x7","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-2gq70x7","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611163942-jyykp28","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-jyykp28","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611163942-u81f9oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-u81f9oh","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张寿颐：浮萍，轻浮最甚，故上宣肺气，外达皮毛，发汗泄热，下通水道，《本经》、《别录》、大明诸家主治，无不在此范围之内。然不仅专人气分，而兼清血热，故《圣济》以治吐血不止，《圣惠方》又治鼻舰，濒湖以治目赤、口疮，既善清火，而又导热下行，其效良捷。近人止以为发汗之药，而不知清热正其专长，殊觉未尽其用。且其质最轻，气味皆薄，虽曰发汗，性非温热，必无过汗之虑。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-tx47jrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-tx47jrv","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611163942-n1h66pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163942-n1h66pr","updated":"20240611163942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163943-n0yn0zr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163943-n0yn0zr","updated":"20240611163944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--"}]},{"ID":"20240611163944-x2b1clk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163944-x2b1clk"}}]}